<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Features on Wanderer</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/</link><description>Recent content in Features on Wanderer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Last Modified Sidebar</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/last_modified_sidebar/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/last_modified_sidebar/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;You can configure your site to show list of last 10 modified or created pages.&#10;The date is taken from &lt;code&gt;lastmod&lt;/code&gt; attribute of the the page, which represents&#10;&lt;em&gt;last modification date&lt;/em&gt; of the given page. Hugo determines this value on its&#10;configuration (see &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io/configuration/front-matter/#dates"&gt;Hugo Front Matter Dates&lt;/a&gt;).&#10;The default configuration of top 4 is (only top 4):&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;git information for given page - date of last revision (commit) in local&#10;repository (&lt;code&gt;enableGitInfo&lt;/code&gt; muset be configured)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;lastmod&lt;/code&gt; front matter attribute&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;modified&lt;/code&gt; front matter attribute&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;date&lt;/code&gt; front matter attribute&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To switch the side bar on, extend configuration of your site (&lt;code&gt;config.yaml&lt;/code&gt; in root folder&#10;of your site) of the parameter &lt;code&gt;showLastModifiedSidebar&lt;/code&gt; and set it to &lt;code&gt;yes&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Code Blocks</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/codeblocks/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/codeblocks/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="without-type"&gt;Without type&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;This is plain code block&#10;without setting any type&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id="bash-block"&gt;Bash block&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;echo &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;This is bash command&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;And this one has long lines&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;echo &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;This is a very long bash command that cannot fit into content area of the generated website, so it needs a scrollbar&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="this-is-javascript"&gt;This is javascript&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-javascript" data-lang="javascript"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;);&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Data Table</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/datatable/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/datatable/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Data table allows to list data in page front matter in tabular format with possibility of:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;filtering&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;selecting columns&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;specifying text for missing data&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;grouping&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Definition of data in page front matter:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;---&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Data Table&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;books&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;keys&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Title&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;highlight&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;style&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;white-space: nowrap&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;filtered&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Author&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;filtered&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;rating&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Rating&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;Summary&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;missing_value&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;/a&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;group&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2005&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;The Clockmaker of Hollow Street&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Eleanor H. Whitford&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;rating&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;A reclusive clockmaker uncovers blueprints for a device that could rewind time, drawing him into a conspiracy that threatens his quiet town.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;genre&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;fantasy&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ashes of the Azure Empire&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Kaito Renn&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;rating&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;After the fall of a once-majestic empire, a former general must protect a young scholar who may hold the key to rebuilding civilization.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; - &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;The Orchard of Silent Promises&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;author&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Lucia Maren&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;rating&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;summary&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;When a woman returns to her childhood village to settle her late mother’s estate, she discovers a mysterious orchard said to grant wishes—but at a price.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rendering a table:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Data Table Remote</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/datatable-remote/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/datatable-remote/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Data table can fetch data from other page and specify filtering to subset show&#10;subset of origin list.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; datatable&#10; key=&amp;#34;books&amp;#34;&#10; page=&amp;#34;/features/datatable&amp;#34;&#10; filter=&amp;#34;genre=fantasy,rating=4&amp;#34;&#10; showgroups=false&#10; columns=title &amp;gt;}}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;table id="datatable" class="datatable"&gt;&#10; &lt;thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;th&gt;&#10; &lt;span onclick="toggleInput(this.parentNode)"&gt;Title&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;input type="text" onkeyup="filterTable()" placeholder="Title"&gt;&#10; &lt;/th&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;/tr&gt;&#10; &lt;/thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tbody&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;td class="highlight" style="white-space: nowrap"&gt;&#10; The Clockmaker of Hollow Street&#10; &lt;/td&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;/tr&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;/tbody&gt;&#10;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10; function normalize(str) {&#10; return str&#10; .toLowerCase()&#10; .normalize("NFD") &#10; .replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, ""); &#10; }&#10;&#10; &#10; function toggleInput(th) {&#10; th.classList.toggle("active");&#10; const input = th.querySelector("input");&#10; if (th.classList.contains("active")) {&#10; input.focus();&#10; } else {&#10; input.value = "";&#10; filterTable();&#10; }&#10; }&#10;&#10; function filterTable() {&#10; const table = document.getElementById("datatable");&#10; const rows = table.getElementsByTagName("tr");&#10; const inputs = table.querySelectorAll("thead input");&#10;&#10; for (let i = 1; i &lt; rows.length; i++) {&#10; const cells = rows[i].getElementsByTagName("td");&#10; let visible = true;&#10;&#10; for (let j = 0; j &lt; inputs.length; j++) {&#10; const filter = normalize(inputs[j].value);&#10; if (filter) {&#10; const cellText = cells[j] ? normalize(cells[j].innerText) : "";&#10; if (!cellText.includes(filter)) {&#10; visible = false;&#10; break;&#10; }&#10; }&#10; }&#10; rows[i].style.display = visible ? "" : "none";&#10; }&#10; }&#10;&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>Documents</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/documents/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/documents/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is page content. All documents stored in &lt;code&gt;docs&lt;/code&gt; subdirectory are listed&#10;below this paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="list-documents"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class="list-item"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; &#10;&#10; &lt;i class="fas fa-file-pdf"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a href="https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/documents/docs/lorem-ipsum.pdf"&gt;docs/lorem-ipsum.pdf&lt;/a&gt; - Lorem Ipsum Example&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Galleries</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/galleries/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/galleries/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;If there are some images stored as resources for given page, theme will render&#10;interactive image gallery at the bottom of the page. This example also&#10;demonstrate how to use resources metadata to describe and order images.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The params for the single image can contain following parameters:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.weight&lt;/code&gt; - (optional) number which specify order of the image. Lower values will sort&#10;images to the beginning. The weight could be negative and must be quoted.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.featured&lt;/code&gt; - (optional) true/false value to specify that given image&#10;will be used on higher levels (e.g. in list of blog posts) to represent the&#10;current page/post.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.gallery&lt;/code&gt; - (optional) number which specifies which gallery image&#10;belongs to. This brings possibility to group images into multiple galleries.&#10;&lt;strong&gt;Gallery with index 0&lt;/strong&gt; has special meaning - image will be hidden.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Images In Single Post</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/images_in_single_post/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/images_in_single_post/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is page shows how to insert single images into content text. There are&#10;multiple ways - via makrdown notation or hugo keyword &lt;code&gt;figure&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="disable-gallery"&gt;Disable gallery&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;If you decide to insert images (stored in a subdirectory of the post) manually&#10;to the text, it could be handy to disable disable automatic generated image gallery at the bottom&#10;of the page. This can be configured in page front matter - the boolean attribute &lt;code&gt;hide_gallery&lt;/code&gt;. Setting&#10;the value to &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt; will disable gallery&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Map With Tags</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/map-tags/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/map-tags/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;No content shown here is rendered, all content is based in the appropriate template&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Setting a very low sitemap priority will tell search engines this is not important content.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Map With Tags And Tracks</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/map/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/map/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;No content shown here is rendered, all content is based in the appropriate template&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Setting a very low sitemap priority will tell search engines this is not important content.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Maps</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/maps/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/maps/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;If there is at least one gpx file in resources of given page, it will be&#10;automatically rendered at the bottom of the page, including basic legend with&#10;distance, time and possibility to download individual gpx files. If the gpx&#10;file contains waypoints, all will be rendered with appropriate icons (see next&#10;chapters).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="waypoints-and-icons"&gt;Waypoints and Icons&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The gpx file can contain both tracks and waypoints (POI - points of interest). Current version&#10;of the template supports following symbols (icons):&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Markdown</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/markdown/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/markdown/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is an overview of various markdown elemens to see wanderer rendering.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="lists"&gt;Lists&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Simple list:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;first item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;second item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;third item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Nested list:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;first item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;second item&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;first sub item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;second sub item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;third sub item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;third item&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Side Navigation</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/side_navigation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/side_navigation/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="first-chapter"&gt;First Chapter&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit. Nullam at arcu a est&#10;sollicitudin euismod. Etiam ligula pede, sagittis quis, interdum ultricies,&#10;scelerisque eu. Phasellus rhoncus. Etiam commodo dui eget wisi. Suspendisse&#10;sagittis ultrices augue. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing&#10;elit. Maecenas fermentum, sem in pharetra pellentesque, velit turpis volutpat&#10;ante, in pharetra metus odio a lectus. Nullam lectus justo, vulputate eget&#10;mollis sed, tempor sed magna. Suspendisse sagittis ultrices augue.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Tag Related List</title><link>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/tag-related-list/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/features/tag-related-list/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is a page which has relation to other pages.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;&lt;div class="list-pages"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="page"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="page-link" href="https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/posts/high-tatras/"&gt;High Tatras&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class ="page-date"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2024-04-21 00:00:00 &amp;#43;0000 UTC"&gt;21 April 2024&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="page"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="page-link" href="https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/posts/smokovec/"&gt;Smokovec&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class ="page-date"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2020-04-22 00:00:00 &amp;#43;0000 UTC"&gt;22 April 2020&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="list-pages"&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="page"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="page-link" href="https://mnezerka.github.io/wanderer/posts/high-tatras/"&gt;High Tatras&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;div class ="page-date"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2024-04-21 00:00:00 &amp;#43;0000 UTC"&gt;21 April 2024&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10